---
description: Avoid single-use, text-only wrapper composables
globs: app/src/main/java/**/*.kt
alwaysApply: false
---

# Text-only composables

- Do **not** create a separate `@Composable` solely to wrap a `Text(...)` call when:
  - It is only used in **one** place, and
  - It has no logic, slots, or styling parameters beyond what can be expressed inline.
- Prefer inlining `Text(...)` directly in the screen/layout in these cases.
- Extract a text composable only when:
  - It is reused across multiple call sites, **or**
  - It encapsulates non-trivial behavior (e.g. ellipsis rules, click handling, animated style changes).

